							<h1 class="bottom-fivesome-spacing large-font-trio strong-woven compact-orb midnight-script small-large-font-quartet small-tight-flow medium-large-font-fivesome medium-tight-flow">Interior design shaped around the way you live</h1>
							<p class="bottom-dozen-spacing foundation-text strong-gray-text balanced-weave serene-ascend text-body-color">
								Lumen and Loft explores how thoughtful interior design can make a home feel more personal, comfortable and coherent. From the first conversation, the focus is on understanding how you use each room, what you value, and which details matter most to you. Layout, colour, materials, lighting and furnishings can then be considered as parts of one joined-up vision. Whether you are rethinking a single space or considering several rooms, the design direction should reflect the character
								of your home and the people who live in it. Project scope, deliverables and timing are discussed and agreed individually, so the process starts with clear expectations rather than assumptions.
							</p>
