								<h2 class="shadowed-gray-text tall-text title-font balanced-weave bottom-duo-spacing">A coherent visual direction</h2>
								<p class="calm-flow foundation-text">
									Colour, materials, furnishings and lighting work best when they are considered together. Rather than treating each decision as a separate purchase, Lumen and Loft can help establish a visual direction that gives the room a sense of connection. This may involve exploring tones, finishes, textures and proportions in relation to the existing architecture and the pieces you want to keep. The aim is not to impose a fixed style, but to help you make choices that feel considered,
									balanced and appropriate to your own home.
								</p>
