								<h2 class="shadowed-gray-text tall-text title-font balanced-weave bottom-duo-spacing">Attention to the details</h2>
								<p class="calm-flow foundation-text">
									Small decisions can influence how a room feels and functions: the placement of a light, the scale of a piece of furniture, the contrast between finishes or the way a walkway remains clear. Looking closely at these details can help bring a broader design idea into everyday use. The relevant level of specification depends on the agreed project scope, and questions can be raised as ideas develop. A careful review of the details supports a more joined-up design process without
