		<div id="n1x2e">
			<div class="pure-light top-bottom-border">
				<div class="lateral-center maximum-width-extra-large-septet lateral-sextet-padding vertical-sixteen-padding small-vertical-twenty-four-padding large-lateral-octo-padding">
					<div class="lateral-center maximum-width-extra-large-duo central-script">
						<h2 class="large-font-twosome strong-woven tenfold-ascend close-distance shadowed-gray-text">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
						<p class="top-sextet-spacing foundation-text septuple-ascend deep-gray-seal">These answers offer a general introduction to discussing an interior design project with Lumen and Loft. The right approach depends on your home, priorities and the scope you have in mind, so specific deliverables, timing and other details should be confirmed directly before work begins.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="top-twenty-spacing">
						<dl class="vertical-space-sixteen small-cosmic-field small-dual-grid small-lateral-gap-six small-vertical-gap-sixteen small-no-vertical-space large-lateral-space-decade">
							<div>
								<dt class="foundation-text assertive-twist septuple-ascend shadowed-gray-text">What can I discuss in an initial enquiry?</dt>
								<dd class="top-duo-spacing foundation-text septuple-ascend deep-gray-seal">You can describe the room or rooms you are considering, what you would like to change, and any practical needs or preferences that should inform the design. It can also be helpful to mention the pieces you plan to keep. The project scope and possible next steps can then be discussed.</dd>
							</div>
							<div>
								<dt class="foundation-text assertive-twist septuple-ascend shadowed-gray-text">Can I ask about a single room?</dt>
								<dd class="top-duo-spacing foundation-text septuple-ascend deep-gray-seal">You can enquire about a single room or a wider area of your home. Whether a particular request is a fit depends on the project and the agreed scope, so share a brief description of the space and what you have in mind.</dd>
							</div>
							<div>
								<dt class="foundation-text assertive-twist septuple-ascend shadowed-gray-text">What should I prepare before getting in touch?</dt>
								<dd class="top-duo-spacing foundation-text septuple-ascend deep-gray-seal">A short description of your space, the way you use it and the changes you are considering is a useful starting point. You may also share reference images or notes about colours, materials and furnishings you like, if available. No particular preparation is required to begin a conversation.</dd>
							</div>
							<div>
								<dt class="foundation-text assertive-twist septuple-ascend shadowed-gray-text">How are project scope and timing confirmed?</dt>
								<dd class="top-duo-spacing foundation-text septuple-ascend deep-gray-seal">The scope, deliverables and timing should be discussed and agreed individually after the project requirements are understood. Details are not assumed from a general enquiry; ask for clarification about what is included before deciding how to proceed.</dd>
							</div>
						</dl>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
